{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://img.tvb.com/inews_admin/pro/20260519/entry_horizontal_6a0bb300b0221bc870017357_1779151899918_640x360.jpg\"><p>日本經濟增長速度快過市場預期。</p><p>日本首季國內生產總值年化增長率百分之2.1，較預測高0.4個百分點。去年第四季度增幅，則由百分之1.3，下修至百分之0.8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-19T01:37:30.533562+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":78,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}